      "title": "RPC_NETLOGON: Fixes parsing errors in NetrServerPasswordSet2 request/reply",
      "message": "RPC_NETLOGON: Fixes parsing errors in NetrServerPasswordSet2 request/reply\n\n* First 4 parameters of NetrServerPasswordSet2 are identical from\n  NetrServerAuthenticate3\n* UNICODE_STRING_512 is 512 bytes long, not 512 wchar_t long\n* netlogon_dissect_netrserverpasswordset2_reply parsed the AUTHENTICATOR\n  incorrectly\n",
      "author_name": "Maxime Meignan",
      "author_email": "meignanmaxime@hotmail.fr",
